WEBVTT

00:00:04.030 --> 00:00:05.900
Houjou Sophie...

00:00:06.240 --> 00:00:09.170
What kind of voice do you sing with?

00:00:13.960 --> 00:00:15.380
Thank you for tuning in.

00:00:15.380 --> 00:00:16.940
I'm Tokuda Nene,

00:00:16.940 --> 00:00:21.750
and I'm up this early to get a scoop on the movie star Hibiki-sama.

00:00:22.250 --> 00:00:24.680
Now then, let's find him.

00:00:28.440 --> 00:00:31.070
I'm off.

00:00:32.730 --> 00:00:34.620
Pushuu~.

00:00:46.270 --> 00:00:48.230
I'm going up?

00:00:54.650 --> 00:00:56.110
Morning.

00:00:56.430 --> 00:01:02.080
G-Good morning, Acting Principal.

00:01:04.590 --> 00:01:06.330
Surprised?

00:01:06.330 --> 00:01:08.760
I moved into one of the condos a few days ago.

00:01:09.960 --> 00:01:11.930
Thanks for looking after us.

00:01:11.930 --> 00:01:13.480
Houjou Sophie-kun.

00:01:13.480 --> 00:01:14.530
Yes?

00:01:14.530 --> 00:01:16.260
I've heard a lot about you.

00:01:16.930 --> 00:01:18.720
You mesmerise people with your cool concerts,

00:01:19.300 --> 00:01:21.590
and you are a natural born super idol.

00:01:27.150 --> 00:01:30.200
Pushuu~.

00:01:34.290 --> 00:01:37.500
I really do like prodigies.

00:01:38.170 --> 00:01:39.530
Let me give you something.

00:01:42.990 --> 00:01:44.930
It's a Celeb Flash.

00:01:44.930 --> 00:01:51.060
This is a fruit that exceeds the powerful plum that your father has been working towards.

00:01:51.060 --> 00:01:53.920
They're easy for me to come by.

00:01:53.920 --> 00:01:55.960
Please try it.

00:01:55.960 --> 00:01:57.520
I'm sorry.

00:01:58.220 --> 00:02:03.680
I only eat Red Flash right before a concert...

00:02:04.180 --> 00:02:07.480
You're perfect when you're on stage.

00:02:07.480 --> 00:02:10.020
That's how you should always be.

00:02:18.570 --> 00:02:20.530
The elevator has arrived.

00:02:20.950 --> 00:02:22.490
Perhaps it's the residents?

00:02:26.000 --> 00:02:28.830
We've arrived at the lobby, so move.

00:02:34.700 --> 00:02:36.380
This is a huge scoop!

00:02:41.140 --> 00:02:43.550
And his partner was Sophie...?

00:02:47.860 --> 00:02:49.270
Would you like a ride?

00:04:33.440 --> 00:04:36.590
Cool Scandal☆ Thanks for tuning in!

00:04:44.950 --> 00:04:45.970
Woah there!

00:04:50.450 --> 00:04:51.140
Huh?

00:04:51.470 --> 00:04:52.830
Good girl.

00:04:55.340 --> 00:04:57.060
Why is Sophie...

00:04:57.060 --> 00:04:58.990
...with Shikyouin?

00:05:01.980 --> 00:05:03.550
How bizarre.

00:05:03.550 --> 00:05:05.010
What's going on here?

00:05:05.010 --> 00:05:05.450
Pushuu~.

00:05:05.450 --> 00:05:08.310
Our Sophie, who normally acts like this,

00:05:08.310 --> 00:05:08.620
has suddenly become like this!

00:05:08.620 --> 00:05:09.870
Good girl.

00:05:09.870 --> 00:05:12.700
It's obvious something is amiss!

00:05:13.100 --> 00:05:14.160
Sophie-sama!

00:05:14.690 --> 00:05:16.580
Good morning!

00:05:16.580 --> 00:05:18.630
Good morning, my little birds.

00:05:19.320 --> 00:05:22.090
Make sure you follow me.

00:05:22.090 --> 00:05:23.270
Yes, ma'am!

00:05:23.270 --> 00:05:25.280
We'll follow you anywhere!

00:05:25.280 --> 00:05:26.060
Chanko!

00:05:26.060 --> 00:05:26.540
Wai-

00:05:26.540 --> 00:05:27.550
Eh?!

00:05:28.140 --> 00:05:30.230
Morning, Sophie!

00:05:30.230 --> 00:05:31.280
Morning.

00:05:31.280 --> 00:05:32.020
What's this?

00:05:32.020 --> 00:05:35.000
You're acting kind of different today...

00:05:35.000 --> 00:05:36.020
Oh!

00:05:36.650 --> 00:05:38.400
Your cowlick is missing!

00:05:38.400 --> 00:05:39.980
You're missing the point!

00:05:41.950 --> 00:05:43.950
Sophie-sama's probably acting like this...

00:05:43.950 --> 00:05:46.930
...because she's aiming for the upcoming Autumn Dream Idol GrandPrix...

00:05:46.930 --> 00:05:50.640
...and decided to put more effort into her everyday life.

00:05:50.640 --> 00:05:52.450
She's full up on cool-chanko!

00:05:53.340 --> 00:05:54.740
Houjou-san!

00:05:54.740 --> 00:05:59.130
You shouldn't mislead people by suddenly showing up with that cool demeanour.

00:05:59.130 --> 00:06:01.400
Paprika Private Academy rule number 9-

00:06:02.330 --> 00:06:05.870
Those who fear change shall not prosper.

00:06:05.870 --> 00:06:07.130
Don't you agree?

00:06:09.090 --> 00:06:12.070
Wow, Sophie-sama!

00:06:12.950 --> 00:06:15.520
I wonder what got into Sophie-san...?

00:06:15.520 --> 00:06:19.250
Do you think she ate something like 100 Red Flash this morning?

00:06:19.250 --> 00:06:20.600
If I may.

00:06:20.600 --> 00:06:23.760
I'm Tokuda Nene from Paprika Academy's Newspaper Club.

00:06:23.760 --> 00:06:26.020
Sophie-san's transformation...

00:06:26.020 --> 00:06:28.640
Are you interested in finding out the truth?

00:06:28.640 --> 00:06:30.440
I'm sure you're interested.

00:06:30.440 --> 00:06:32.620
So you know something?

00:06:32.620 --> 00:06:35.790
They say that love changes people, right?

00:06:36.110 --> 00:06:37.750
Getting right to the point, I, Tokuda,

00:06:38.200 --> 00:06:42.590
got the low-down on Sophie's morning love life!

00:06:42.590 --> 00:06:44.720
Sophie's love life?!

00:06:45.650 --> 00:06:48.240
Listen and be amazed! This isn't for the feint of heart!

00:06:48.240 --> 00:06:52.270
While Hibiki-sama and Sophie were in the elevator, Hibiki-sama...

00:06:53.960 --> 00:06:55.720
What did he do to Sophie?!

00:06:55.720 --> 00:06:57.250
Want to know?

00:06:57.250 --> 00:06:59.940
We're listening so spit it out!

00:06:59.940 --> 00:07:02.250
From up against a wall,

00:07:02.250 --> 00:07:04.140
he took her chin,

00:07:04.140 --> 00:07:06.650
and kissed her like this!

00:07:06.940 --> 00:07:09.250
Back to your old tricks again, eh?

00:07:09.250 --> 00:07:11.110
I have photographic evidence.

00:07:13.570 --> 00:07:15.010
Eh?!

00:07:15.010 --> 00:07:15.860
It's true!

00:07:15.860 --> 00:07:17.260
They're totally flirting!

00:07:17.260 --> 00:07:19.630
Though, I'm not sure they actually kissed.

00:07:19.630 --> 00:07:22.790
I'll leave the rest to your imagination.

00:07:22.790 --> 00:07:27.360
Tokuda Nene shall now head out and carefully observe their affection.

00:07:27.360 --> 00:07:30.290
Now then, please excuse me!

00:07:32.090 --> 00:07:33.720
How immodest!

00:07:34.540 --> 00:07:37.480
Students must focus on studying!

00:07:37.480 --> 00:07:39.430
Students- No...

00:07:39.880 --> 00:07:41.850
Idols are not allowed to fall in love!

00:07:41.850 --> 00:07:43.520
Eh? A boyfriend?

00:07:43.520 --> 00:07:45.150
There's no way-pri!

00:07:45.150 --> 00:07:47.900
Wha'd she mean by the anteater and the hippopotamus?

00:07:47.900 --> 00:07:51.290
Geez, that was against the wall he took her chin.

00:07:51.290 --> 00:07:53.200
Leona, why don't you show her.

00:07:53.200 --> 00:07:53.860
Eh?

00:07:54.280 --> 00:07:55.770
Well...

00:07:55.770 --> 00:07:56.650
Yes?

00:07:56.650 --> 00:08:00.320
Against the wall...

00:08:00.320 --> 00:08:03.330
He takes her chin...

00:08:06.250 --> 00:08:08.250
I can't do it!

00:08:09.560 --> 00:08:11.270
Guess we'll have to explain it another way.

00:08:11.270 --> 00:08:15.210
From against the wall he takes her chin!

00:08:15.210 --> 00:08:16.970
That's not even close!

00:08:17.400 --> 00:08:19.680
One rice ball, Ma'am!

00:08:19.680 --> 00:08:21.400
One yakisoba roll!

00:08:27.190 --> 00:08:28.710
One egg-salad sandwich.

00:08:29.270 --> 00:08:31.150
H-Here.

00:08:32.740 --> 00:08:34.420
Sophie-sama!

00:08:34.420 --> 00:08:35.360
You two...

00:08:35.740 --> 00:08:36.570
Yes?

00:08:37.350 --> 00:08:39.450
Prepare yourselves for today.

00:08:39.450 --> 00:08:41.540
We're going to perform until we burn out.

00:08:41.540 --> 00:08:44.240
Oh. Sure, that's fine.

00:08:44.240 --> 00:08:46.000
Sophie's in high spirits today.

00:08:46.480 --> 00:08:51.420
And you girls shall experience a stimulation like you've never had before!

00:08:54.570 --> 00:08:55.380
Chanko!

00:08:56.960 --> 00:08:57.870
Oh?

00:08:57.870 --> 00:08:59.350
I'm looking forward to that.

00:08:59.800 --> 00:09:03.250
Andou, prepare the usual roses.

00:09:03.250 --> 00:09:05.790
Yes, I'm counting on you.

00:09:08.580 --> 00:09:10.400
PriPara Change!

00:09:12.780 --> 00:09:14.160
Complete!

00:09:15.630 --> 00:09:17.440
Oh, Sophie, um...

00:09:17.440 --> 00:09:19.870
You're shining brightly today-kuma.

00:09:20.270 --> 00:09:22.420
Did something happen-kuma?

00:09:22.420 --> 00:09:23.080
Kuma?

00:09:23.510 --> 00:09:24.100
Kumama?!

00:09:24.100 --> 00:09:25.150
Where are you taking me-kuma?!

00:09:25.150 --> 00:09:26.380
H-Hey! That hurts!

00:09:26.380 --> 00:09:28.040
Wait up!

00:09:30.110 --> 00:09:32.250
What's going on-kuma?!

00:09:32.700 --> 00:09:34.100
Question.

00:09:34.100 --> 00:09:35.200
Go ahead.

00:09:35.200 --> 00:09:38.110
What is the highest number of consecutive concerts anyone has done?

00:09:38.690 --> 00:09:40.110
One moment.

00:09:41.120 --> 00:09:44.610
The current record is five consecutive concerts.

00:09:44.610 --> 00:09:45.480
I see.

00:09:45.480 --> 00:09:47.100
Then in that case,

00:09:47.100 --> 00:09:49.360
I'd like to double it and do ten consecutive concerts.

00:09:49.360 --> 00:09:50.190
Ten?!

00:09:50.190 --> 00:09:51.650
Eh?!
Pri?!

00:09:52.290 --> 00:09:55.100
If you actually do ten consecutive concerts,

00:09:55.100 --> 00:09:57.720
that will be an accomplishment that'll go down in PriPara history!

00:09:57.720 --> 00:09:58.620
Good.

00:09:58.620 --> 00:10:00.870
Since, after accomplishing that goal,

00:10:01.430 --> 00:10:06.080
it is my hope that we will rank up to Divine Idol and stand atop the world of PriPara.

00:10:09.040 --> 00:10:10.500
Eh?!
Kuma?!

00:10:10.860 --> 00:10:12.710
In that case...

00:10:16.650 --> 00:10:18.050
Let me verify.

00:10:18.050 --> 00:10:20.750
It's not like you can become Divine Idols in a day-kuma.

00:10:20.750 --> 00:10:22.790
There's no way something so ridiculous would be approved anyway.

00:10:22.790 --> 00:10:24.320
It's been okayed!
No helping it. Nothing you could have done.

00:10:24.320 --> 00:10:24.890
It was?!

00:10:24.890 --> 00:10:26.600
Okayed?!
Okayed-pri?!

00:10:27.000 --> 00:10:29.360
I had Mega-niisan verify it,

00:10:29.360 --> 00:10:32.750
and to honour your spirit to challenge and achieve such a difficult task,

00:10:32.750 --> 00:10:34.070
he okayed it.

00:10:37.030 --> 00:10:37.460
Ta-da!

00:10:37.460 --> 00:10:39.990
By having ten successful concerts,

00:10:40.510 --> 00:10:44.700
SoLaMi Smile will be Divine Idols by nightfall!

00:10:44.700 --> 00:10:48.050
D-Divine Idols, huh?

00:10:48.050 --> 00:10:49.570
My heart's pounding.

00:10:49.570 --> 00:10:50.670
No way.

00:10:50.670 --> 00:10:53.760
There's no way you'll be able to do something like that-kuma.

00:10:53.760 --> 00:10:57.730
We have a .002% chance of success.

00:10:57.730 --> 00:11:00.720
I realise that it's a hopeless gamble,

00:11:00.720 --> 00:11:03.950
but it's a huge chance for SoLaMi Smile!

00:11:03.950 --> 00:11:05.660
Let's put everything into it!

00:11:05.660 --> 00:11:09.280
So, when you're excited, you forget to end your sentence with "pri", huh-kuma?

00:11:09.280 --> 00:11:10.900
Oh man...

00:11:19.130 --> 00:11:21.870
Please scan the appropriate number of My Tickets for your coord.

00:11:22.450 --> 00:11:24.870
You can also scan each other's Friend Tickets.

00:11:25.580 --> 00:11:27.590
Coord Change Start!

00:11:28.290 --> 00:11:31.800
It's been decided that SoLaMi Smile will be using their latest coords to start off their consecutive concerts:

00:11:31.800 --> 00:11:33.620
their Parasol Series Coords!

00:11:33.620 --> 00:11:34.460
Sunny!

00:11:34.460 --> 00:11:35.010
Rainy!

00:11:35.010 --> 00:11:35.780
Cloudy!

00:11:35.780 --> 00:11:37.210
Parasol Coord!

00:11:37.970 --> 00:11:38.820
Pri.

00:11:42.880 --> 00:11:44.810
Your attention, everyone.

00:11:44.810 --> 00:11:51.930
SoLaMi Smile is going to try to do ten consecutive songs with a rank up to Divine Idols hanging in the balance!

00:11:52.980 --> 00:11:54.950
My little songbirds,

00:11:54.950 --> 00:11:57.230
I'll be flying to the sun today.

00:11:57.230 --> 00:12:00.950
Make sure to hold on tight so you aren't shaken loose.

00:12:02.250 --> 00:12:03.410
So cool!

00:12:03.410 --> 00:12:06.320
You can do it, Sophie-sama!

00:12:06.320 --> 00:12:07.370
Chanko!

00:12:07.370 --> 00:12:08.830
Are they serious?!

00:12:10.700 --> 00:12:12.190
Song one!

00:12:12.190 --> 00:12:13.250
Round one.

00:12:57.670 --> 00:13:01.010
Making Drama Switch On!

00:13:01.010 --> 00:13:01.920
Princess...

00:13:01.920 --> 00:13:04.260
Princess, where are you-kuma?!!

00:13:06.760 --> 00:13:08.260
Kuma?

00:13:08.260 --> 00:13:10.020
Flower garden in full bloom!

00:13:10.020 --> 00:13:11.270
For you!

00:13:11.930 --> 00:13:15.180
Lovely Flower Cinderella!

00:13:15.180 --> 00:13:16.630
Kuma!

00:13:18.390 --> 00:13:20.950
Cyalume Change!

00:13:26.930 --> 00:13:28.280
Pri.

00:13:46.610 --> 00:13:48.680
Not bad. You must be tired.

00:13:48.680 --> 00:13:51.200
We don't have time for a break.

00:13:51.200 --> 00:13:51.970
Let's go.

00:13:51.970 --> 00:13:53.430
Sure thing!
Sure thing-pri!

00:13:53.430 --> 00:13:55.660
We don't have time for a break!

00:13:55.660 --> 00:13:57.900
Let's dash to the next concert studio!

00:13:58.400 --> 00:14:00.400
Chanko!

00:14:05.610 --> 00:14:07.030
Please scan your My Tickets.

00:14:07.030 --> 00:14:08.610
You can also scan each other's Friend Tickets.

00:14:08.610 --> 00:14:10.320
Coord Change Start!

00:14:10.820 --> 00:14:12.240
Whatever matches!

00:14:12.240 --> 00:14:14.790
Fluffy Pompom Mixture Coord!

00:14:14.790 --> 00:14:16.080
Pri.

00:14:16.950 --> 00:14:18.240
Song two.

00:14:18.240 --> 00:14:19.290
Round two.

00:14:46.780 --> 00:14:48.470
Song three!

00:14:48.470 --> 00:14:49.490
Round three.

00:14:59.330 --> 00:15:00.930
Song four!

00:15:00.930 --> 00:15:02.040
Round four.

00:15:09.120 --> 00:15:11.180
Pushuu~.
Pushuu~pri.

00:15:11.180 --> 00:15:13.660
See, I told you so-kuma.

00:15:13.660 --> 00:15:17.040
You haven't even done half of them and you're already this tired-kuma

00:15:17.040 --> 00:15:18.230
Pushushuu~.

00:15:18.230 --> 00:15:21.150
You just don't have the stamina, do you, little songbirds?

00:15:21.630 --> 00:15:23.360
Guess I'll have to breathe some life back into you.

00:15:23.360 --> 00:15:24.620
Eh?

00:15:33.290 --> 00:15:36.120
Have you been good...

00:15:36.510 --> 00:15:38.830
...my little cagebirds-pri?

00:15:38.830 --> 00:15:40.330
Yes!

00:15:41.790 --> 00:15:43.000
You're lying!

00:15:43.400 --> 00:15:45.460
No way!

00:15:45.460 --> 00:15:46.980
We haven't...

00:15:47.890 --> 00:15:49.590
...been that good...

00:15:49.590 --> 00:15:51.430
...either!

00:15:57.350 --> 00:15:59.810
Pushuu-Pushushushushushu~~~~.

00:16:00.160 --> 00:16:04.900
Even the effect of Sophie's electric kiss only brought you this far-kuma.

00:16:04.900 --> 00:16:06.770
Pull it together, you two-kuma!

00:16:07.380 --> 00:16:09.740
Capisce.

00:16:10.200 --> 00:16:15.450
Sophie, I want you to do your best until the end-pri.

00:16:16.290 --> 00:16:17.410
Leave it to me.

00:16:17.410 --> 00:16:18.640
Six.

00:16:22.590 --> 00:16:23.640
Seven.

00:16:28.420 --> 00:16:29.760
Eight.

00:16:35.890 --> 00:16:37.810
I'm speechless!

00:16:37.810 --> 00:16:40.510
Sophie-san has performed songs six, seven, and eight!

00:16:40.510 --> 00:16:44.500
And with this, she's completed their ninth concert!

00:16:44.500 --> 00:16:48.150
You truly are a prodigy, Sophie.

00:16:48.150 --> 00:16:50.930
Cool! Cool! Cool!

00:16:50.930 --> 00:16:51.770
Chanko!

00:16:52.450 --> 00:16:53.950
Pushuu~.

00:16:54.560 --> 00:16:56.070
Sorry for the interruption!

00:16:56.780 --> 00:16:59.110
You're rushing to your tenth song.

00:16:59.110 --> 00:17:00.940
Does this mean, when you're done,

00:17:00.940 --> 00:17:04.640
you're going to announce your love for Hibiki-sama?

00:17:04.640 --> 00:17:07.190
Can I get a word on that?

00:17:07.190 --> 00:17:08.320
You're kidding, right?

00:17:08.320 --> 00:17:09.630
I hate jokes.

00:17:09.630 --> 00:17:10.960
What's this?!

00:17:10.960 --> 00:17:12.870
I don't need a scoop to make myself known.

00:17:12.870 --> 00:17:14.720
I'll make the news myself.

00:17:16.660 --> 00:17:18.780
Wow! So cool!

00:17:18.780 --> 00:17:19.900
This is troublesome!

00:17:19.900 --> 00:17:22.760
Has Tokuda once again jumped to conclusions?

00:17:23.910 --> 00:17:28.840
Does this mean that it'll only be Sophie who'll become a Divine Idol-kuma?!

00:17:30.050 --> 00:17:30.520
Kuma?

00:17:32.590 --> 00:17:34.440
Sophie...

00:17:34.440 --> 00:17:38.230
Finally, here comes the attempt at their tenth consecutive concert!

00:17:38.230 --> 00:17:39.160
Round ten!

00:17:39.160 --> 00:17:40.470
This makes it your tenth song!

00:17:40.470 --> 00:17:41.310
Last.

00:17:41.310 --> 00:17:42.120
The last one!

00:17:42.490 --> 00:17:49.040
My cute little songbirds, want to see the birth of a Divine Idol?

00:17:49.040 --> 00:17:51.000
We do!
We do-chanko!

00:17:51.490 --> 00:17:53.170
Then let's fly!

00:17:53.170 --> 00:17:55.630
Fasten your seat belts!

00:17:55.630 --> 00:17:57.970
She's becoming a Divine Idol...

00:18:05.310 --> 00:18:06.980
Pushuu~!

00:18:08.190 --> 00:18:09.150
Sophie!

00:18:09.150 --> 00:18:19.000
Pushuu~.

00:18:19.000 --> 00:18:21.990
It seems the Celeb Flash's effect has worn off.

00:18:22.410 --> 00:18:26.320
I would have liked to have seen more, but there seems to be a time limit.

00:18:26.320 --> 00:18:29.610
Sophie has quit just before the end!

00:18:29.610 --> 00:18:31.710
She didn't complete their tenth song!

00:18:37.550 --> 00:18:39.610
Are you okay, Sophie?

00:18:41.580 --> 00:18:44.050
You shouldn't sit up yet-kuma!

00:18:44.050 --> 00:18:46.490
I need to perform...

00:18:46.490 --> 00:18:48.360
It's already over.

00:18:48.360 --> 00:18:50.920
Your attempt at becoming Divine Idols was a failure.

00:18:50.920 --> 00:18:53.610
So make sure to get some rest, okay-kuma?

00:18:54.290 --> 00:18:55.610
You're wrong.

00:18:56.060 --> 00:18:58.590
I need to thank everyone.

00:18:59.490 --> 00:19:04.480
I want to do the first song again.

00:19:08.500 --> 00:19:12.130
We may have failed our attempt at becoming Divine Idols,

00:19:12.470 --> 00:19:14.150
but for those who cheered for us,

00:19:14.150 --> 00:19:17.340
let's perform another concert for them!

00:19:17.960 --> 00:19:19.880
Despite that, it was still awesome!

00:19:19.880 --> 00:19:22.400
It was exhausting just listening...

00:19:22.400 --> 00:19:23.720
Girls!

00:19:23.720 --> 00:19:24.890
Eh?

00:19:26.430 --> 00:19:27.960
Thank you!

00:19:27.960 --> 00:19:30.140
Let's put everything into one last song-pri!

00:19:31.430 --> 00:19:33.110
...yeah!

00:19:34.670 --> 00:19:37.760
<i>I'll fill all these little songbirds with love.</i>

00:20:13.560 --> 00:20:16.650
Making Drama Switch On!

00:20:17.890 --> 00:20:19.530
Save us!

00:20:19.530 --> 00:20:21.530
Someone save us!

00:20:34.010 --> 00:20:37.060
Liberation Maiden Valkyria!

00:20:37.060 --> 00:20:39.250
Beauty Venus!

00:20:40.480 --> 00:20:43.280
Cyalume Change!

00:20:49.230 --> 00:20:50.430
Pri!

00:21:07.080 --> 00:21:08.020
Sophie-sama!

00:21:08.020 --> 00:21:09.450
You're so cool, Sophie-sama!

00:21:09.450 --> 00:21:11.450
She is so cool!

00:21:18.200 --> 00:21:21.920
Anyway, I got you to show me your hidden powers.

00:21:22.590 --> 00:21:26.810
You are an idol worthy of winning the Idol GrandPrix.

00:21:28.370 --> 00:21:30.850
Now then, the next one I'll go after...

00:23:05.760 --> 00:23:08.780
It seems you're serious, Shikyouin Hibiki.

00:23:08.780 --> 00:23:09.880
Of course.

00:23:09.880 --> 00:23:10.780
In that case...

00:23:11.420 --> 00:23:13.240
It seems this will be truly enjoyable.

00:23:13.900 --> 00:23:14.830
Next time:

00:23:14.830 --> 00:23:16.520
Shion vs Hibiki.

00:23:16.520 --> 00:23:17.810
Aim for your dreams!

00:23:17.810 --> 00:23:19.790
Let's go PriPara!
